  ('Python', 'technical', 'medium', 'What is a list comprehension commonly used for?', '["Building a list from an iterable with optional transformation or filtering", "Defining a class", "Opening a network port", "Declaring a package"]', 'Building a list from an iterable with optional transformation or filtering', 'A list comprehension creates a list by iterating, optionally transforming or filtering values.'),
  ('Python', 'technical', 'medium', 'What is the purpose of a virtual environment?', '["Isolating project dependencies", "Converting code to machine language", "Encrypting source files", "Replacing the Python interpreter"]', 'Isolating project dependencies', 'Virtual environments isolate installed packages for a project.'),
